                <pb facs="1172" n="1076" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1076"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10 in No. 5]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Nunes to Mr. Schmitt.</hi></head>
                <p>Your telegram of Saturday to Cushing received Sunday, too late for Colon cable.
                    It goes forward at 10 this morning. Supply further particulars for transmission
                    with former telegram. Do so at once.</p>
            </div>
